  "instructions": [
    {
      "id": 58422,
      "primary_message": "Fill a large pot halfway with water, cover, and bring to a boil. Uncover, add salt and pasta, and stir for a few seconds. Cook until desired firmness, 8-10 minutes.",
      "secondary_message": "about 21 cups water\n3 tbsp salt\n510 g (1 quarter coin = 56 g) spaghetti pasta"
    },
    {
      "id": 58418,
      "primary_message": "Peel and mince garlic. In a medium bowl, prepare sauce by whisking together garlic, water, peanut butter, vinegar, soy sauce, honey, oil, and pepper.",
      "secondary_message": "3 cloves garlic\n6 tbsp warm water\n12 tbsp natural peanut butter\n3 tbsp rice vinegar\n3 tbsp soy sauce\n1 ½ tbsp honey\n1 ½ tbsp toasted sesame oil\n⅜ tsp crushed red pepper"
    },
    {
      "id": 58423,
      "primary_message": "Toss broccoli slaw into a large bowl. Wash and dry cilantro. Shave leaves off the stems; discard the stems and mince the leaves. Add to bowl.",
      "secondary_message": "1 ½ (340 g) pkg broccoli slaw\n1 ½ small bunches cilantro"
    },
    {
      "id": 58424,
      "primary_message": "Wash and cut limes into wedges. Roughly chop peanuts.",
      "secondary_message": "1 ½ limes\n¾ cup peanuts, roasted unsalted"
    },
    {
      "id": 58419,
      "primary_message": "Drain pasta in a colander and rinse under cold water. Shake to drain excess liquid, then add to bowl with broccoli slaw.",
      "secondary_message": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 58420,
      "primary_message": "Pour peanut sauce over top and toss to coat.",
      "secondary_message": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 58421,
      "primary_message": "To serve, place noodles in a bowl and garnish with peanuts and lime wedges. Enjoy!",
      "secondary_message": ""
    }
  ],
